<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ruleset name="Java 共通規範" xmlns="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0"
         xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
         xsi:schemaLocation="http://pmd.sourceforge.net/ruleset/2.0.0 https://pmd.sourceforge.io/ruleset_2_0_0.xsd">
  <description>依 tools/java/rule-map.yml 建立；候選規則不在預設集合。</description>
  <!-- JV-ND-028 -->
  <rule name="DateTimeFormatterPatternNotStrict" language="java" class="net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.rule.xpath.XPathRule" message="[JV-ND-028] 解析與輸出契約 → rules/stacks/java/common/numbers-dates-text.md#java-temporal-parsing-formatting" externalInfoUrl="https://github.com/clarkeforwork-coder/dev-rule/blob/main/rules/stacks/java/common/numbers-dates-text.md#java-temporal-parsing-formatting">
    <description>涵蓋條文「須明訂格式、地區…不允許寬鬆修正」的預設 SMART 情況（未呼叫 withResolverStyle）；注意 STRICT 必須搭配 uuuu 而非 yyyy，否則解析失敗；可另加 XPath 檢查 STRICT 鏈上的字面樣式含 yyyy；；誤報風險說明：只用於格式化輸出的 formatter 不需要 STRICT；formatter 存成欄位後另行 withResolverStyle 也會被報；ofPattern 未給 Locale 在純數字 ISO 樣式下影響有限；建議 warn；；實證版本：17。</description>
    <priority>1</priority>
    <properties>
      <property name="xpath"><value><![CDATA[//MethodCall[@MethodName='ofPattern'][TypeExpression/ClassType[pmd-java:typeIs('java.time.format.DateTimeFormatter')]][ArgumentList/@Size = 1 or not(ancestor::MethodCall[@MethodName='withResolverStyle'][ArgumentList/FieldAccess/@Name='STRICT'])]]]></value></property>
    </properties>
  </rule>
</ruleset>
